      "text": "[9:28PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement subsided on Lagos Abeokuta Expressway from Goye inward Danco through Iyana Ipaja underneath the bridge, the return journey of same stretch is good.\n\nFast movement on Iyana Ipaja bridge inward the roundabout with no delay up to Mosalasi, Abesan Gate, Baruwa U-Turn, and Opeki, while return journey of entire stretch is also free.\n\nMokola, Egbeda, Olugbede, Seliat, Orelope, Pipeline, Isheri Roundabout are all good movement at the moment.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
